counterexample:
Using an RAII guard that automatically resets the thread-local state when dropped:
```rust
struct TransactionGuard;
impl Drop for TransactionGuard {
    fn drop(&mut self) {
        CURRENT_TRANSACTION.with(|c| *c.borrow_mut() = None); // Auto reset
    }
}
